<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="homepage-bg"> 

    <header class="site-header">
        <div class="logo-container">
            <img src="/pics/123.avif" alt="Logo" class="shop-logo">
        </div>

        <nav class="navbar">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/vehicletype">Vehicle Type</a> 
            <a href="/about">About</a>
            <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <main class="container">
            <section class="hero-section">
                <h1>Welcome to the Infinity Car's</h1>
                <div class="overview-container">
                    <p class="intro-text">
                        Let's! Dive into the world of transportation. Learn fascinating facts about 
                        cars, motorcycles, and aircrafts, or test your skills in our high-speed challenge.
                    </p>
                    <p class="intro-text">
                        Ready to test your transport knowledge? Our quiz covers the evolution, mechanics, and 
                        history of how we move across the globe. Here’s a quick look at what you’ll encounter:
                    </p>
                    
                    <div class="vehicle-grid">
                        <div class="vehicle-item">
                            <h3>Cars & Land Travel</h3>
                            <p>From the first steam-powered engines to modern electric hypercars. Learn about iconic brands and the engineering behind the wheels.</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="vehicle-item">
                            <h3>Motorcycles</h3>
                            <p>Explore the world of two-wheelers, from classic cruisers to high-speed racing bikes that defy the limits of balance and speed.</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="vehicle-item">
                            <h3>Aircrafts</h3>
                            <p>Take to the skies! Discover the physics of flight, famous aviators, and the massive machines that connect continents in hours.</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="vehicle-item">
                            <h3>Watercrafts</h3>
                            <p>Dive deep into maritime history—from ancient wooden galleons to massive modern cruise ships and stealthy submarines.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="cta-container">
                    <a href="/quiz" class="start-quiz-btn">START QUIZ</a>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>
    </div>


    <footer class="site-footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 CJH-VEHICLE QUIZ</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>		